</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-engage-caption field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Discover gallery exhibitions, musical performances, dance, theater and so much more. <a data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="fd73d791-4fe3-43fc-858d-00ca6aae6e87" href="/campus-life/arts" title="The Arts">Explore the arts</a> of our community.</p>
