            <div class="field field--name-field-label field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>Athletics</h3>
</div>
      
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-engage-caption field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Let’s go, Hawks! HC’s talented athletics teams have garnered recognition in regional, state and national competitions. For schedules, tickets, stats and more, visit <a href="https://hcflhawks.com/landing/index">HC Athletics</a>.</p>
</div>
      
