            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-engage-caption field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Each <a href="/campus-life" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="f8745945-d80c-46f3-aa8b-525ec41fc962" title="Campus Life">HC campus</a> offers a diverse mix of student clubs, organizations and events. It’s easy to get involved in the community, network for a future career&nbsp;or just have some fun.</p>
